cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QuakeScope: Machine Learning-based Seismic Phase Picking at Cloud Scale"
abstract: >
  A cloud-native workflow for automated seismic phase picking and earthquake
  detection using deep learning (PhaseNet v7), deployed on AWS with containerized
  models, elastic computing (Batch/Fargate), and managed database (DocumentDB).
  Includes tools for model validation, cloud monitoring, and earthquake association.

